+.TH oscam.guess 5
+.SH NAME
+\fBoscam.guess\fR - CAID guessing table for OSCam
+.SH SYNOPSIS
+CAID guessing table
+.SH DESCRIPTIONS
+.PP
+\fB<length of ECM>\fP:\fB<CAID>\fP
+.RS 3n
+CAID guessing table by len in hex, only needed for protocols (at the moment BOMBA protocol only) that does not pass CAIDs
+.RE
+.SH EXAMPLES
