+ Compression
+    lzo1x_1_compress()
+
+ Decompression
+    lzo1x_decompress()
+    lzo1x_decompress_safe()
+
+ Checksum functions
+    lzo_adler32()
+
+ Version functions
+    lzo_version()
+    lzo_version_string()
+    lzo_version_date()
+
+ Portable (but slow) string functions
